Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 10:44:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/22] experiment: keep dynarmic at the old pin 3140648a66

The PS5 port's JIT glue (headless/dynarmic/*.cmake) patches dynarmic by
exact text; upstream changed 35 of its files. The interface differs only
in an arm64 exclusive monitor path.
